  "hints": [
    "Traders need pushed updates, not polling. And they all watch the same symbols.",
    "Latest quotes belong in memory; history belongs in a time-series database.",
    "WebSocket gateway (12) → quote service (56) → Redis (3) → InfluxDB (2); price feed → Kinesis → processors (2) → InfluxDB."
  ],
