    "latencyTargetMs": 35,
    "costBudget": 6624
  },
  "explanation": [
    "Gateways hold connections and subscribe to per-symbol channels; each price tick is published once and fanned out.",
    "Keep the latest quote per symbol in memory and the history in a time-series store with downsampling for older data.",
    "Conflate updates per client: a trader only needs the newest price, not every tick in between."
  ]
